    {
      "id": 42857,
      "nameEs": "Super Spy Hunter",
      "originalName": "Super Spy Hunter",
      "year": 1991,
      "igdbId": 6154,
      "popularity": 9,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Super Spy Hunter",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Super Spy Hunter",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "After Japanese video game developer Sunsoft ported Spy Hunter to the Nintendo Entertainment System, the company created Battle Formula with similar gameplay. Sunsoft America signed a deal with Bally Midway to release it outside Japan as Super Spy Hunter.\n\nThe Super Spy Hunter has a super spy car. It's actually a well-armed car that can turn into a boat or a plane at opportune times. The action is fast vertical scrolling as the vehicle faces all manner of powerful vehicle threats from a well-funded terrorist enemy -- cars, trucks, helicopters, etc. Luckily, there are many powerups to collect along the way, both defensive and offensive.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Después de que la desarrolladora japonesa Sunsoft portara Spy Hunter a Nintendo Entertainment System, la compañía creó Battle Formula, con una jugabilidad similar. Sunsoft America firmó un acuerdo con Bally Midway para lanzarlo fuera de Japón como Super Spy Hunter.\n\nSuper Spy Hunter tiene un superauto de espionaje. En realidad es un auto bien armado que, en los momentos oportunos, se transforma en bote o avión. La acción es un desplazamiento vertical rápido mientras el vehículo enfrenta toda clase de amenazas vehiculares poderosas de un enemigo terrorista bien financiado: autos, camiones, helicópteros, etc. Por suerte, en el camino hay muchos potenciadores que recoger, tanto defensivos como ofensivos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
